  "body": "SIR-Agent and RemoteEvolver arrived through monitoring after the initial publication. Add their source-bound, independently reviewed summaries to the November 20 supplement, using the actual dated review merged in #171. November 20 now contains 10 papers and W47 contains 34 daily papers; the 33 previously published historical entries remain separate.\n\nPreserve original publication/version dates, first_seen, previous publication timestamps and prior approvals. The November 23 status snapshot stays unchanged. PhyRSI is recorded as a scope exclusion. SIR-Agent's unresolved scenario-count mapping remains explicit and is not repeated as a verified numerical claim.\n\nValidation: build and schema validation passed; the second build changed 0 of 13,944 checked file hashes; a second application of the three-ID subset changed 0 records. Independent publication review checked source hashes, old snapshots, both new summaries, latest.json, Atom and the preserved withdrawal. Full PR CI must pass before merge; Pages and public bytes will be verified afterward. No paid model-generation request was made.\n",
